# Tenant module (contracts/openapi/tenant.yaml). Get tokens with auth.http first.

### The caller's tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Create a location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"name": "Store room {{$randomInt}}", "type": "STORE", "address": {"line1": "12 Main Street", "city": "Kandy"}}

> {% client.global.set("locationId", response.body.id); %}

### All settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Sales settings (keeps the ETag for the update below)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

> {% client.global.set("salesEtag", response.headers.valueOf("ETag")); %}

### Update sales settings
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{salesEtag}}

{"values": {"returnWindowDays": 10}}

### Receipt templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipt-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Create a tenant (platform administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"name": "Demo shop {{$randomInt}}", "businessType": "RETAIL_GROCERY"}

### A cashier may not change settings (403 ACCESS_DENIED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{salesEtag}}

{"values": {"returnWindowDays": 30}}
